          "url": "https://github.com/YerbaPage/SWE-Debate/blob/8a7d46263e7bea4cd6563c19166b7592ac386b13/README.md#L11-L11"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a9900a79d05189b930019a8fb0273c17895343b4b119fb7b8eb6737206064f1c"
      ],
      "text": "The project includes an Entity Localization Pipeline built on the Moatless framework."
    },
    {
